<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="command">reply</ansi>

The <ansi fg="command">reply</ansi> command sends a whisper back to the last
person who whispered to you.

<ansi fg="yellow">Usage: </ansi>

  <ansi fg="command">reply <message></ansi>    Whisper back to your last sender.

If no one has whispered to you since you logged in, or if the
sender has gone offline, the command will let you know.

Reply supports chains — when you reply, the other person can
reply back to you, and so on.

<ansi fg="magenta-bold">See also:</ansi> <ansi fg="command">help whisper</ansi>
